   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Hello,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">I am trying to use your gheatmap function to visualize a tree with associated\r\nmatrix. I am a relative beginner to R. Your example code works properly on my\r\nsystem, but when I use my data I can generate the tree, but when I call\r\ngheatmap I get the following error:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&gt; gheatmap(p, heatdata,\r\noffset=2, width=0.5)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Error in seq.default(h[1],\r\nh[2], length.out = n) : <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">  &#39;to&#39; cannot be NA, NaN or infinite<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">I find R error messages to be\r\nvery unhelpful, so I am at a loss how to troubleshoot this. I have tried\r\nloading both categorical (text) and numeric data, I get the same errors for\r\nboth. Is there something I’m missing regarding table or data format? Attached\r\nare my input files and below is the full code I am trying to run. Any advice\r\nwould be much appreciated.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Thank you and best regards,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Mark Evans<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><br></span></p><div style=\"border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 1.0pt 0in\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"border:none;padding:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">library(&quot;ggtree&quot;,\r\nlib.loc=&quot;/usr/local/lib/R/3.3/site-library&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">library(&quot;dplyr&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">library(readr)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">library(&quot;colorspace&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">tree &lt;-\r\nread.tree(&quot;ggtree_test_tree.nwk&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">annot&lt;-read_tsv(&quot;ggtree_test_annotation.txt&quot;,col_names=c(&quot;XPA&quot;,&quot;HCfam&quot;))<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">hc &lt;-\r\nlapply(distinct(select(annot,HCfam)),as.character)$HCfam<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">hc_cls&lt;-list()<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">for(x in 1:length(hc))<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">{<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span>   </span>chain&lt;-hc[x]<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span>   </span>hc_cls[[chain]] &lt;-\r\nlapply(select(filter(annot,HCfam==chain),XPA),as.character)$XPA<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">}<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">tree &lt;- groupOTU(tree,\r\nhc_cls)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">heatdata &lt;-\r\nread_tsv(&quot;ggtree_test_annotation.txt&quot;,col_names=c(&quot;XPA&quot;,&quot;HCfam&quot;))<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">p&lt;-ggtree(tree,\r\naes(color=group)) + <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span>     </span>geom_tiplab(size=3) + <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span>    \r\n</span>scale_color_manual(values=c(&quot;black&quot;, rainbow_hcl(length(hc))),\r\nlabels=c(hc), name=&quot;Heavy Chain Family&quot;) + <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span>     </span>theme(legend.position=&quot;left&quot;,\r\nlegend.key=element_rect(color=&quot;White&quot;))<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">gheatmap(p, heatdata,\r\noffset=2, width=0.5)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>"
    ]
   ]
