     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Hello,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">I am trying to use your gheatmap function to visualize a tree with associated\r\nmatrix. I am a relative beginner to R. Your example code works properly on my\r\nsystem, but when I use my data I can generate the tree, but when I call\r\ngheatmap I get the following error:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&gt; gheatmap(p, heatdata,\r\noffset=2, width=0.5)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Error in seq.default(h[1],\r\nh[2], length.out = n) : <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">  &#39;to&#39; cannot be NA, NaN or infinite<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">I find R error messages to be\r\nvery unhelpful, so I am at a loss how to troubleshoot this. I have tried\r\nloading both categorical (text) and numeric data, I get the same errors for\r\nboth. Is there something I’m missing regarding table or data format? Attached\r\nare my input files and below is the full code I am trying to run. Any advice\r\nwould be much appreciated.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\